{#
  Stage 0 base configuration template.

  Variable precedence at work: when launched from AWX with the survey enabled,
  the survey answers arrive as extra_vars, which outrank group_vars. That is the
  cold open's whole argument — an operator retypes facts the network already
  knows, and those typed values win over the source of truth.

  This same template is reused in Lab 2, unchanged, once the values come from
  Nautobot Config Contexts instead of group_vars. Keeping it stable across the
  swap is what makes the "nothing else changed" moment land.
#}
hostname {{ inventory_hostname }}
!
{% for server in ntp_servers %}
ntp server {{ server }}
{% endfor %}
!
{% for server in dns_servers %}
ip name-server {{ server }}
{% endfor %}
!
snmp-server community {{ snmp_community }} ro
!
logging host {{ syslog_host }}
!
